Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.00,0:00:04.78,Header,,0,0,0,,This is a Gentlemen of the Hàn free fansub.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.40,0:00:07.60,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,900,3860,5800)\pos(635.909,318.09)}Episode 46
Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.40,0:00:07.60,Episode Title,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,900,3860,5800)\pos(635.909,507.818)}The Sleeping Dragon Mourns
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.44,0:00:31.84,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(936.001,452.001)}Lǔ Sù\NStyled: Zǐjìng
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.78,0:00:31.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.54,0:00:35.54,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,4700,5020)\pos(965.671,466.212)}Zhōu Yú \NStyled: Gōngjǐn
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.42,0:00:34.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.62,0:00:39.50,Default,,0,0,0,,I didn't heed you at the outset, and ever since...
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.58,0:00:44.82,Default,,0,0,0,,I've been humiliated!
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.62,0:00:51.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, look after your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:52.14,0:00:55.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Speak no more of painful things.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:08.66,0:01:11.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I have served my country with utmost loyalty,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.46,0:01:18.10,Default,,0,0,0,,but alas, this is my fate.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:19.64,0:01:29.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Gentlemen, I hope that you will work together to aid our lord's great cause.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:29.86,0:01:31.70,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(321.333,638.667)}Xiǎo Qiáo
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.10,0:01:37.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:37.54,0:01:38.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Father!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.86,0:01:41.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Father, Father...!
Dialogue: 0,0:01:45.02,0:01:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't cry...
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.60,0:01:53.30,Default,,0,0,0,,There is not much time left.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:58.62,0:02:01.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Don't let this hinder everything.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:05.90,0:02:06.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Help me up.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.38,0:02:36.46,Default,,0,0,0,,My husband,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.14,0:02:38.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I will write for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.90,0:02:47.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}I, Zhou Yu, am but a man of modest skill, \Nfortunate to have found in you, sire, a worthy master.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.54,0:02:54.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}You placed in me great trust, \Ngranting me the command of the three armies.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.78,0:02:59.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}As of now, Cao Cao's land of Wei threatens our northern borders,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.66,0:03:02.98,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,Wèi (魏) is the region named after the city and nation of Wei of the Eastern Zhou dynasty, corresponding to parts of modern-day Henan, Hebei, Shanxi, and Shandong.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.78,0:03:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(646.667,651.333)}while Liu Bei lurks nearby, dangerous as a tiger.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:03.66,0:03:07.91,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,651.333)}Our nation's success and failure is uncertain,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.62,0:03:15.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,651.333)}yet in this chaos I now depart. How can I be at peace?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:16.66,0:03:25.38,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}Fortunately, there is Lu Su. Loyal, farsighted, and steadfast, he is a great talent sent to you by Heaven!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.46,0:03:29.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,651.333)}He can be entrusted with important tasks.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.62,0:03:34.24,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,651.999)}When the time comes, delegate all powers to Zijing,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.50,0:03:36.26,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,651.999)}and there shall be no calamity.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.26,0:03:39.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,651.999)}A dying man's words have no ill intent.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.90,0:03:42.33,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}If you honor me and heed my advice,\Nthough I die...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.10,0:03:45.62,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,651.999)}I shall die with no regret!
Dialogue: 0,0:03:50.50,0:03:51.50,Default,,0,0,0,,My dear lady...
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.02,0:04:04.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}People say Kongming and I are like fire and water, locked in the strife of two.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:06.34,0:04:14.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}Yet only he could understand the true \Nmeaning of my {\i1}Song of the Yángzǐ River.{\i0}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.34,0:04:25.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}We all serve our masters, standing on each side.\NTo clash is only natural.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.94,0:04:27.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}Yet...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.47,0:04:35.38,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}In all our clashes, he has beaten me.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:42.54,0:04:46.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}Is this the will of Heaven...
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.36,0:04:50.33,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}...or is this because of human strength?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:33.38,0:05:40.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}You had Zhou Yu,\Nwhy make Zhuge Liang?
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.78,0:05:55.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}You had Zhou Yu,\Nwhy make Zhuge Liang!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.14,0:06:29.74,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Commander, come back! Commander, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:06:54.25,0:06:57.70,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(298.667,465.333)}Zhūgě Liàng\NStyled: Kǒngmíng
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.40,0:06:58.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, Zhou Yu is dead. We have one fewer rival for Jing Province. You should be happy.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:58.06,0:07:02.38,Default,,0,0,0,,Besides, that Zhou the Youth was petty, and tried to get rid of you again and again.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:03.26,0:07:07.36,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(940,473.333)}Zhào Yún\NStyled: Zǐlóng
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.78,0:07:07.70,Default,,0,0,0,,I heard some men from Jiangnan say that he looked to Heaven before his death, and cried out,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:07.78,0:07:10.18,Default,,0,0,0,,"you had Zhou Yu,\Nwhy make Zhuge Liang?"
Dialogue: 0,0:07:10.32,0:07:15.38,Default,,0,0,0,,His hatred for you was plain to see. Why, then, is your heart so heavy?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:17.88,0:07:20.84,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}They say that Zhou Yu \Nwas envious of others' talent,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:22.44,0:07:23.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}but that is not so.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:24.22,0:07:28.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}Otherwise, he would not have had my brother, Zhuge Jin,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:28.88,0:07:30.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}ask me to join Eastern Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:32.88,0:07:39.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}It was not that Zhou Yu hated how my talents surpassed his.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.56,0:07:43.68,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}Rather, he hated that my ability could not be used to aid Eastern Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:44.32,0:07:46.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}Zhou Yu's acumen and erudition exceed all else.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.92,0:07:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}A once-in-a-generation Scholar's General.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.36,0:07:54.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}Now his ambition, unrealized, falls like a star.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.74,0:07:59.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}How can the heroes of the world not be united in sorrow?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.60,0:08:01.80,Default,,0,0,0,,No. Absolutely not.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:02.00,0:08:05.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Everyone in Jiangdong blames you \Nfor their Commander's death.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:05.32,0:08:09.29,Default,,0,0,0,,Going there to mourn is like entering a tiger's den: odds not in your favor.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.20,0:08:17.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}After Gongjin's death, Lu Su will have succeeded him.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.08,0:08:22.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}He has always stood for the Sun-Liu alliance against Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.98,0:08:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}The time is now, while he becomes a Commander, to reaffirm our ties.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:26.86,0:08:28.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)} How could I let fear lead to inaction?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.18,0:08:35.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}Besides, I can use this as a chance to recruit potential talents from Jiangdong.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.30,0:08:37.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}All to aid you, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:37.58,0:08:40.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Even so, I am ill at ease.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.72,0:08:44.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Eastern Wu is in deep sorrow from the loss,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.06,0:08:46.28,Default,,0,0,0,,and Cao Cao will be thinking of retaliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.36,0:08:49.22,Default,,0,0,0,,At this time, Sun Quan will not look to quarrel,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:49.78,0:08:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,to say nothing of the fact that\NZilong will be my escort.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.72,0:08:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,There is no risk at all!
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.08,0:08:58.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Rest assured, my lord. I will make sure no harm befalls the Strategos.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.00,0:09:01.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Though Sun Quan and Lu Su\Nwould like to keep our alliance,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.90,0:09:05.10,Default,,0,0,0,,I am afraid that the generals\Nof Eastern Wu will harm you.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.22,0:09:08.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I was not afraid while Zhou Yu was alive.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:09.18,0:09:10.88,Default,,0,0,0,,And now that Zhou Yu is dead,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:11.75,0:09:12.93,Default,,0,0,0,,what is there to fear?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.22,0:09:16.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Still, be careful.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:18.90,0:09:20.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Many thanks, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.34,0:09:46.14,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:47.84,0:09:51.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I apologize that in this state,\NI am unable to greet you properly.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.34,0:09:53.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Please forgive me, my lord.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:05.00,0:10:10.64,Default,,0,0,0,,My lady, the funeral is tomorrow.\NLook after your health.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:11.02,0:10:17.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Please go...\NPlease go and rest with the children.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:18.04,0:10:22.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I will guard the casket in shifts with Zijing and others.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:22.80,0:10:26.57,Default,,0,0,0,,You, sir, are busy with state affairs, and still \Nyou guard my husband's body.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:28.14,0:10:29.74,Default,,0,0,0,,If Gongjin knew,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:30.62,0:10:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,he would be jubilant on the other side.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:32.98,0:10:34.66,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,400,3700,4100)\pos(308.072,494.061)}Sūn Quán \NStyled: Zhòngmóu
Dialogue: 0,0:10:37.98,0:10:39.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Before my husband died,
Dialogue: 0,0:10:41.10,0:10:48.12,Default,,0,0,0,,he asked me to bequeath this sword to you.
Dialogue: 0,0:10:49.82,0:10:51.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, please...
Dialogue: 0,0:10:59.10,0:11:02.86,Default,,0,0,0,,...aid our lord in achieving the great undertaking...
Dialogue: 0,0:11:06.66,0:11:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,...on his behalf.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:26.86,0:11:27.84,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:33.80,0:11:36.88,Default,,0,0,0,,what is troubling you?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:38.92,0:11:43.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, are you not aware\Nthat disaster is imminent?
Dialogue: 0,0:11:47.58,0:11:50.64,Default,,0,0,0,,I was just informed,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:51.14,0:11:53.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Cao Cao has learned of Gongjin's death,
Dialogue: 0,0:11:53.66,0:11:59.50,Default,,0,0,0,,and he, under Cheng Yu's counsel, is now commanding a great armada southwards.
Dialogue: 0,0:11:59.58,0:12:01.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I am aware of this matter.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:07.22,0:12:12.40,Default,,0,0,0,,My lord Commander, Zhuge Liang, with a retinue of men, has come to pay respect.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:14.88,0:12:16.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Where is Kongming now?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:16.74,0:12:18.56,Default,,0,0,0,,They went to Baqiu at first,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:18.68,0:12:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,but arrived here overnight after learning the funeral would be held at Chaisang.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:24.00,0:12:26.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Kongming's arrival puts us in a difficult situation.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:26.86,0:12:31.52,Default,,0,0,0,,The generals may wish to do him harm, which will drive a rift in the Sun-Liu alliance.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:31.64,0:12:35.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Were Cao Cao's troops to attack us then, Jiangnan would be in danger.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:35.18,0:12:36.90,Default,,0,0,0,,How should we proceed?
Dialogue: 0,0:12:38.38,0:12:42.66,Default,,0,0,0,,We must send Zhuge Jin to intercept him quickly,
Dialogue: 0,0:12:42.80,0:12:46.16,Default,,0,0,0,,and tell his younger brother to turn back and avoid disaster.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:47.12,0:12:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Do as Zijing said.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:49.36,0:12:49.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes milord.
Dialogue: 0,0:12:57.70,0:13:00.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Strategos, fast horses approach from ahead.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:08.22,0:13:09.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:13.30,0:13:15.22,Default,,0,0,0,,Second Brother, you must stop.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.46,0:13:20.50,Default,,0,0,0,,The generals in Eastern Wu all believe that you killed Gongjin.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:15.64,0:13:17.32,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,450,3000,3380)\pos(990.52,481.178)}Zhūgé Jǐn \NStyled: Zǐhéng
Dialogue: 0,0:13:21.36,0:13:23.90,Default,,0,0,0,,They know that you are coming to pay respects.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:23.94,0:13:29.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Cheng Pu and Gan Ning, along with other veteran officers, want to kill you to appease the dead!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:29.64,0:13:32.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Lu Zijing now commands\Nthe three armies of Eastern Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:32.54,0:13:35.50,Default,,0,0,0,,He also urges you not to go to Chaisang.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:35.58,0:13:40.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If Sun and Liu were to fall out,\NCao Cao would have an opportunity!
Dialogue: 0,0:13:42.66,0:13:44.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing is mistaken.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:46.08,0:13:51.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If I turned back now, would it not confirm that I was involved in Zhou Yu's death?
Dialogue: 0,0:13:52.86,0:13:54.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder Brother, you know how I am.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:54.78,0:13:57.52,Default,,0,0,0,,I have never started something I cannot finish.
Dialogue: 0,0:13:57.60,0:13:58.50,Default,,0,0,0,,But-
Dialogue: 0,0:13:58.54,0:14:01.88,Default,,0,0,0,,I have made my decision. Elder Brother, save your words.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:02.44,0:14:05.86,Default,,0,0,0,,I deeply appreciate your warnings.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:07.28,0:14:11.68,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(361.493,503.791)}Chéng Pǔ \NStyled: Démóu
Dialogue: 0,0:14:08.78,0:14:13.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We had all served at Gongjin's side through thick and thin.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:15.84,0:14:17.90,Default,,0,0,0,,His death, his indignation...
Dialogue: 0,0:14:19.86,0:14:23.24,Default,,0,0,0,,It is all because of Zhuge Liang!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:24.36,0:14:27.20,Default,,0,0,0,,Now, he dares to come mourn him in Chaisang.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:27.28,0:14:29.58,Default,,0,0,0,,He mocks us of Eastern Wu as weak-willed!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:30.02,0:14:31.78,Default,,0,0,0,,I will see him dead.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:32.96,0:14:34.48,Default,,0,0,0,,Who will aid me?
Dialogue: 0,0:14:38.36,0:14:40.88,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General, your words echo my own thoughts.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.24,0:14:45.08,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Gan Ning, am at your disposal!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:41.84,0:14:43.96,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(944.422,474.667)}Gān Níng \NStyled: Xīngbà
Dialogue: 0,0:14:45.58,0:14:49.06,Default,,0,0,0,,Tomorrow we meet him with hidden swords, kill him on sight!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:49.28,0:14:52.82,Default,,0,0,0,,When our lord comes for punishment, I will take the blame alone.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:53.06,0:14:54.84,Default,,0,0,0,,We will take the blame together!
Dialogue: 0,0:14:55.04,0:14:59.92,Default,,0,0,0,,Since the death of the Commander, the officers have turned their hatred to Liu Bei and Zhuge Liang.
Dialogue: 0,0:14:59.96,0:15:02.78,Default,,0,0,0,,They all wish to invade Jing Province in retaliation.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:02.90,0:15:06.72,Default,,0,0,0,,Vice-Commander Cheng Pu was most taken \Nby the Chief Commander's kindness,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:06.78,0:15:08.62,Default,,0,0,0,,and so he pushes for vengeance too.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:09.54,0:15:11.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My command of the three armies is too recent.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:11.86,0:15:14.90,Default,,0,0,0,,If I were to stop them, I fear\NI would lose their support.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:16.24,0:15:17.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:17.62,0:15:19.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you not wish to avenge Gongjin?
Dialogue: 0,0:15:20.10,0:15:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}Gongjin and I were as close as brothers.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:22.62,0:15:25.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}I grieve deeply for his untimely death.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:26.72,0:15:30.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}But, my lord, you have trusted me\Nwith the affairs of the state.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:31.22,0:15:34.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}My loyalty, first and foremost, is to our state,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:34.84,0:15:36.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}and not to my own feelings.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:37.40,0:15:42.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}At this moment, Cao Cao is advancing southwards to annex Jiangdong,
Dialogue: 0,0:15:44.04,0:15:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}while Liu Bei has stretched his wings over the nine commanderies of the district of Han River.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:49.12,0:15:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}If we were to turn on each other, Cao Cao would seize his opportunity.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:52.88,0:15:54.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}The Southlands will be in great peril.
Dialogue: 0,0:15:54.98,0:16:01.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333} If that were to happen, how could I face the people of Jiangdong, or you, my lord?
Dialogue: 0,0:16:57.52,0:17:04.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Last night, Cheng Deshu, Gan Xingba, \Nand others gathered to plot to kill Kongming.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:04.64,0:17:07.48,Default,,0,0,0,,If Kongming dies, how could Liu Bei forgive that?
Dialogue: 0,0:17:07.54,0:17:10.00,Default,,0,0,0,,There would never be peace in Jiangdong again.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:17.26,0:17:19.66,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(390.455,338.182)\i1}Spirit Tablet of\NChief Commander\NZhou Yu
Dialogue: 0,0:17:24.42,0:17:26.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Begin the funeral ceremony.
Dialogue: 0,0:17:26.82,0:17:30.78,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Commander, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:31.58,0:18:33.36,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:34.72,0:18:35.96,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:37.68,0:18:41.96,Default,,0,0,0,,I have come late! Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:42.62,0:18:45.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, stay just a while longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:47.22,0:18:48.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:52.12,0:18:53.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin,
Dialogue: 0,0:18:54.38,0:18:57.26,Default,,0,0,0,,stay just a while longer!
Dialogue: 0,0:18:58.34,0:19:00.58,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin, Zhuge Liang has come to pay his respects.
Dialogue: 0,0:19:11.24,0:19:13.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Elder General Cheng, order them to cease this at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:19:14.00,0:19:16.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Our lord has ordered you to treat honored guests with courtesy!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:03.94,0:20:06.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Kongming, please.
Dialogue: 0,0:20:22.30,0:20:25.82,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\i1\pos(402.727,484.091)}Spirit Tablet of\NChief Commander\NZhou Yu
Dialogue: 0,0:20:35.86,0:20:36.96,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:48.04,0:20:55.02,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}Gongjin, misfortune has taken you too early!
Dialogue: 0,0:20:56.06,0:21:02.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}At the news of your passing, \Nmy insides writhe painfully!
Dialogue: 0,0:21:05.58,0:21:10.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}At the news of your passing, \Nthe rivers and creeks stopped their flow,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:10.98,0:21:18.90,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}at the news of your passing, \Nthe stars and moon all ceased their glow.
Dialogue: 0,0:21:20.04,0:21:25.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}If your spirit still listens,\Nthen please hear my weeping,
Dialogue: 0,0:21:27.34,0:21:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}if your spirit still thirsts,\Nthen please accept my drink.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.42,0:22:16.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}I lament the young man,\Nthat young friend of Bofu,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:11.14,0:22:16.14,Note (Potential style?),,0,0,0,,i.e. Sūn Cè
Dialogue: 0,0:22:18.10,0:22:24.52,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}he who performed a great undertaking\Nand conquered the South.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:27.28,0:22:32.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}I lament the young warrior\Nguarding distant Baqiu,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:32.42,0:22:40.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}Commander of thousands, \Nrouting armies unstoppable.
Dialogue: 0,0:22:44.56,0:22:50.54,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}I lament the graceful man, \Nwell-matched for Xiao Qiao,
Dialogue: 0,0:22:52.92,0:22:59.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}all places near and far,\Nyou and your wife are praised.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:02.20,0:23:06.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}I lament the tenacious man, \Nwith the will to succeed.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:07.38,0:23:12.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,664)}Dropping no feathers, you flew to great heights.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:13.12,0:23:16.88,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}I lament at Poyang, \Nwhere Jiang Gan came to persuade,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:16.98,0:23:22.36,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}where you, confident \Nand at ease, set your lofty ideals.
Dialogue: 0,0:23:23.64,0:23:27.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}I lament the man of magnificent talents\Nwhich brought the land tranquility,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:28.14,0:23:32.92,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,664)}setting fire to Chibi, bringing doom to the enemy!
Dialogue: 0,0:23:39.14,0:23:43.94,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}I recall you as you were but yesterday, bold and victorious,
Dialogue: 0,0:23:46.26,0:23:54.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}and I mourn your untimely death,\Nblood-thick tears in eyes full.
Dialogue: 0,0:24:02.68,0:24:10.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}I grieve for you, Gongjin!\NI cherished you, Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:24:26.96,0:24:33.00,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}Loyal and upright in heart\Nyour fame will last for ages,
Dialogue: 0,0:24:33.78,0:24:44.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}you'll be praised for \Ngenerations to come.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:01.94,0:25:09.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}My sadness rooted deep will never cease.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:10.44,0:25:17.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}The very Heavens are darkened,\Nthe Earth covered with frost.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:19.98,0:25:25.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}The army grieves over losing its commander,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:26.74,0:25:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}your bright lord mourns the loss of his pillar of state.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:41.70,0:25:47.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}Though I be unworthy, \Nyou asked me to help you plan,
Dialogue: 0,0:25:47.98,0:25:55.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}for Wu's resistance against Cao, for the Liu to save the Han.
Dialogue: 0,0:25:57.22,0:26:02.70,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}As horns assist each other, \Nas each other's front and back,
Dialogue: 0,0:26:04.74,0:26:15.48,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}with your perfect dispositions,\Nhow would the confidence lack?
Dialogue: 0,0:26:17.86,0:26:25.72,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}Alas, Gongjin, the living and the dead are ever separated.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:26.62,0:26:36.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,664)}The world is vast, no matter with an end.
Dialogue: 0,0:26:44.26,0:26:48.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,664)}If spirits are aware, then read now my heart:
Dialogue: 0,0:26:49.82,0:27:01.18,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,664)}where in this world, can I find my dear friend?
Dialogue: 0,0:27:15.10,0:27:16.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:20.98,0:27:22.58,Default,,0,0,0,,don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:23.42,0:27:25.98,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:26.36,0:27:28.74,Default,,0,0,0,,don't go!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:31.02,0:27:32.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:36.06,0:27:38.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin,
Dialogue: 0,0:27:40.46,0:27:43.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I am here!
Dialogue: 0,0:27:57.10,0:27:59.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}Do not cry, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:27:59.58,0:28:03.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}Before he died, Gongjin left behind his last words.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:04.68,0:28:07.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}Expressing that Lu Su would be his successor,
Dialogue: 0,0:28:07.74,0:28:11.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\}in the hope that Sun and Liu would ally against Cao Cao.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:11.82,0:28:14.66,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}I hope that you understand Gongjin's will.
Dialogue: 0,0:28:23.30,0:28:24.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:29.20,0:28:35.90,Default,,0,0,0,,He really understood me, Zhuge Liang!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:38.46,0:28:39.78,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:43.18,0:28:44.42,Default,,0,0,0,,Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:47.86,0:28:49.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Kongming!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:48.74,0:28:49.70,Default,,0,0,0,,-Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:50.10,0:28:52.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing, don't interfere!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:53.26,0:28:55.62,Default,,0,0,0,,{\i1}-Mister Kongming!{\i0}\N-Oh, Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:28:59.30,0:29:01.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}They said these two were enemies,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:02.02,0:29:05.90,Thinking,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}but the sincerity of mourning proves it untrue.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:09.18,0:29:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Kongming!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:12.30,0:29:14.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, Gongjin!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:16.58,0:29:19.30,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Commander, come back!
Dialogue: 0,0:29:26.98,0:29:28.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Kongming,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:28.50,0:29:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,With all the state affairs, \Nthis is as far as I can escort you.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:32.06,0:29:37.26,Default,,0,0,0,,To be able to pay my respects and pour my heart out at Gongjin's funeral was all I wanted.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:37.38,0:29:38.54,Default,,0,0,0,,We'll meet again.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:43.48,0:29:44.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Kongming.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:47.04,0:29:48.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Kongming.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:48.40,0:29:49.50,Default,,0,0,0,,Zijing,
Dialogue: 0,0:29:51.88,0:29:55.66,Default,,0,0,0,,you wish to ask how to resist Cao Cao's army of three hundred thousand?
Dialogue: 0,0:29:55.96,0:29:57.44,Default,,0,0,0,,That's exactly right.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:57.90,0:29:59.32,Default,,0,0,0,,I ask for your advice, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:29:59.78,0:30:01.14,Default,,0,0,0,,That won't be difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:01.82,0:30:05.58,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}Why not spread rumors in the city of Xuchang?
Dialogue: 0,0:30:10.40,0:30:13.86,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}Say that Ma Teng from Xiliang...
Dialogue: 0,0:30:15.18,0:30:16.40,Default,,0,0,0,,I see, I see!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:16.94,0:30:19.82,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}Thank you, sir, for your instructions.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:21.28,0:30:25.46,Default,,0,0,0,,You are my good friend, such trifling matters \Nare not worth mentioning.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:25.56,0:30:28.64,Default,,0,0,0,,It is time for us to bid farewell.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:35.34,0:30:41.76,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Kongming certainly loved him very much. It looks like Zhou Gongjin had been too prejudiced.
Dialogue: 0,0:30:52.90,0:30:55.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Please board the ship, Strategos!
Dialogue: 0,0:30:58.82,0:31:00.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Shiyuan?!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:02.22,0:31:03.70,Default,,0,0,0,,Well, well, Kongming!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:04.30,0:31:07.38,Default,,0,0,0,,You drove Zhou Yu to death, \Nand now came to mourn him...
Dialogue: 0,0:31:07.70,0:31:10.90,Default,,0,0,0,,You sure enjoy ridiculing the Eastern Wu!
Dialogue: 0,0:31:14.60,0:31:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,I was truly sincere. You shouldn't slander my honesty, Shiyuan.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:21.70,0:31:24.80,Default,,0,0,0,,It is not suitable to stay here. Let us talk on the ship.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:27.80,0:31:31.48,Default,,0,0,0,,I wonder, where will Shiyuan be going?
Dialogue: 0,0:31:32.62,0:31:36.14,Default,,0,0,0,,I grew up in Jiangdong, \Nso of course I serve Eastern Wu.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:38.46,0:31:41.14,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}Sun Zhongmou, while he can be regarded as a wise lord,
Dialogue: 0,0:31:41.34,0:31:44.78,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}knows only how to use men, not benefit from their talents.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:49.40,0:31:52.74,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}I doubt you can realize your talents under him.
Dialogue: 0,0:31:54.34,0:31:57.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}If you are not satisfied, you could come to Jing Province
Dialogue: 0,0:31:57.52,0:32:00.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}and help support my lord Imperial Uncle Liu.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:01.06,0:32:04.42,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}He is broad of mind and virtuous,
Dialogue: 0,0:32:04.46,0:32:07.46,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,663.999)}and will see your life's learning utilized.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:08.06,0:32:09.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Fetch ink and pen.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:11.12,0:32:13.68,Default,,0,0,0,,I will write a letter of recommendation for you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:27.14,0:32:29.94,Default,,0,0,0,,In case you come when I'm not in Jing Province.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:30.64,0:32:34.20,Default,,0,0,0,,You can give this letter to the Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:34.76,0:32:36.52,Default,,0,0,0,,Thank you.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:41.82,0:32:43.30,Default,,0,0,0,,-I take my leave.\N-Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:32:47.04,0:32:50.82,Default,,0,0,0,,Brother Shiyuan! If you find it \Ndifficult here, come to Jing Province!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:50.88,0:32:51.76,Default,,0,0,0,,I know!
Dialogue: 0,0:32:56.66,0:33:00.66,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Pang Tong was recommended to Sun Quan by Lu Su,
Dialogue: 0,0:33:01.48,0:33:06.10,Thinking,,0,0,0,,but Sun Quan, put off by the man's odd character and appearance, found him difficult to like.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:06.24,0:33:08.02,Thinking,,0,0,0,,So he was not employed.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:20.78,0:33:22.92,Default,,0,0,0,,I hope your journey wasn't too difficult.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:24.46,0:33:29.90,Default,,0,0,0,,I hear you welcome the wise and receive all talents, so I came to be at your service.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:31.80,0:33:35.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Jing-Xiang has just been pacified, and there are no vacancies.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:37.66,0:33:42.36,Default,,0,0,0,,But Weiyang County is in need of a magistrate. You can take office there.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:42.50,0:33:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,I can offer you the post until there\Nshould be something more fitting.
Dialogue: 0,0:33:50.04,0:33:51.80,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you find this displeasing, sir?
Dialogue: 0,0:33:56.26,0:34:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,This is the first time we meet, and you appoint me to a magistracy.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:02.58,0:34:06.80,Default,,0,0,0,,I, Shiyuan, am ceaselessly grateful.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:08.56,0:34:13.66,Default,,0,0,0,,If there is no objection, please receive your post.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:15.10,0:34:16.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Why, thank you, Imperial Uncle.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:20.60,0:34:22.42,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Sir, troubling news!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:22.46,0:34:25.14,Thinking,,0,0,0,,What, has that Cao Cao's army come crashing down our gates?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:25.18,0:34:27.64,Thinking,,0,0,0,,-No, the Third General is coming! \N-"Third"?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:28.62,0:34:30.30,Default,,0,0,0,,What "Third General"?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:30.34,0:34:31.54,Thinking,,0,0,0,,Zhang Fei, Zhang Yide!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:32.92,0:34:34.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Oh, go away.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:40.88,0:34:42.32,Default,,0,0,0,,You bastard!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:43.08,0:34:46.26,Default,,0,0,0,,You sleep here all day long while ignoring your duties?
Dialogue: 0,0:34:46.46,0:34:47.34,Default,,0,0,0,,Get up!
Dialogue: 0,0:34:48.38,0:34:52.32,Default,,0,0,0,,Your Highness here is not hearing any cases today.
Dialogue: 0,0:34:52.92,0:34:57.30,Default,,0,0,0,,And who might you be? \NHow dare you come harass my grace here?
Dialogue: 0,0:35:00.20,0:35:03.26,Default,,0,0,0,,Third General, just a moment.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:02.78,0:35:03.98,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(980.909,480)}Zhāng Fēi\NStyled: Yìdé
Dialogue: 0,0:35:04.28,0:35:07.00,Default,,0,0,0,,Pang Shiyuan is known to be a man of great ability.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.82,0:35:11.20,That one frame,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,500,4740,5100)\pos(942.4,372.4)}孙乾
Dialogue: 0,0:35:06.82,0:35:11.20,That one frame,,0,0,0,,{\fade(255,0,255,0,500,4740,5100)\pos(1011.2,444.4)}“字 公祐”
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.26,0:35:11.20,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(993.6,459.2)}Sūn Qián\NStyled: Gōngyòu
Dialogue: 0,0:35:07.04,0:35:11.16,Default,,0,0,0,,He was the one who devised the \NChain-Link Stratagem at the Battle of Chibi.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:11.54,0:35:15.08,Default,,0,0,0,,There must be a reason for his drunkenness and tardiness.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:15.34,0:35:19.30,Default,,0,0,0,,Let's inquire into it, then we can punish him according to his offense.
Dialogue: 0,0:35:23.58,0:35:24.66,Default,,0,0,0,,You must be Pang...
Dialogue: 0,0:35:26.58,0:35:27.74,Default,,0,0,0,,Pang, what was it now?!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:28.40,0:35:29.46,Default,,0,0,0,,Páng Tǒng!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:31.50,0:35:35.40,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,665.333)}"Páng" means vast and great!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:36.30,0:35:42.44,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}As ancient poems saith: to cede to the talented and virtuous, is a grace most vast and great!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:42.86,0:35:47.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,665.333)}Tǒng means to lead, to command!
Dialogue: 0,0:35:48.22,0:35:50.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,665.333)}As the Book of Zhou saith：
Dialogue: 0,0:35:51.04,0:35:55.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}"What is the Way of the King?\NIt means to lead a domain in unity!"
Dialogue: 0,0:35:56.26,0:36:00.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}It also says: "To prosper a nation\Nand soothe a country,"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:01.58,0:36:05.22,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,665.333)}"To command the officers and the Four Seas,"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:05.32,0:36:11.10,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}"To quell the land and set boundaries, how vast and great thus so!"
Dialogue: 0,0:36:11.24,0:36:12.34,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,665.333)}Shut up!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:14.36,0:36:17.12,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,665.333)}My brother took you for a man of letters,
Dialogue: 0,0:36:17.18,0:36:20.98,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}and sent you here as magistrate, yet you spend your days as a sloven drunk!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:21.02,0:36:23.30,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,665.333)} You let this county descend into disorder!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:25.46,0:36:31.26,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}Third General, may I ask what affairs I have turned to disorder?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:32.30,0:36:37.20,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333}You've been here for three months and wasted them on being drunk. Have you reviewed a single case?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:37.20,0:36:38.80,Default,,0,0,0,,{\bord11.333\pos(640,665.333)}How is that not disorder?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:43.30,0:36:47.72,Default,,0,0,0,,It is but trifling small county business, what is there to be concerned for?
Dialogue: 0,0:36:48.38,0:36:50.50,Default,,0,0,0,,-Attendant! \N-Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:50.78,0:36:53.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Bring all the documents from the last 100 days at once!
Dialogue: 0,0:36:53.70,0:36:55.74,Default,,0,0,0,,This Highness shall settle them now.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:55.76,0:36:58.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Order the plaintiffs to appear in turns.
Dialogue: 0,0:36:58.62,0:36:59.28,Default,,0,0,0,,Yes.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:00.22,0:37:01.86,Default,,0,0,0,,What is your case?
Dialogue: 0,0:37:04.14,0:37:08.86,Default,,0,0,0,,My son Dazhuang was returning home \Nfrom the salt trade with his sheepskin bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:09.60,0:37:14.56,Default,,0,0,0,,But that wicked gentleman Li Liu insisted the bag was his family's.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:15.48,0:37:20.82,Default,,0,0,0,,My son wouldn't give it to him, and they beat him until he was crippled!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:22.20,0:37:25.18,Default,,0,0,0,,Summon the defendant Li Liu with the material evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:28.04,0:37:28.36,Default,,0,0,0,,Kneel!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:31.30,0:37:34.04,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire, the bag is clearly my family's.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:34.30,0:37:36.26,Default,,0,0,0,,The seal of my family is on it!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:37.20,0:37:38.18,Style Names,,0,0,0,,{\pos(777.524,197.333)}Lǐ
Dialogue: 0,0:37:42.17,0:37:46.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Sire, that seal is recent.\NPlease make a fair judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:46.76,0:37:49.54,Default,,0,0,0,,It was there long ago!
Dialogue: 0,0:37:50.82,0:37:53.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Neither of you are backing down.
Dialogue: 0,0:37:54.76,0:38:00.40,Default,,0,0,0,,Attendant, cut the bag into two.\NEach of you take a piece of the bag.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:01.18,0:38:02.52,Default,,0,0,0,,And be gone with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:04.86,0:38:07.84,Default,,0,0,0,,Sir, we've been wronged, we've been wronged!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:07.70,0:38:09.56,Default,,0,0,0,,-I refuse to accept this!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:11.90,0:38:13.60,Default,,0,0,0,,One said it's wrong.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:14.42,0:38:16.00,Default,,0,0,0,,The other refuses judgment.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:18.58,0:38:19.64,Default,,0,0,0,,Alright.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:20.32,0:38:23.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Then each of you will take half of the bag,
Dialogue: 0,0:38:23.30,0:38:27.14,Default,,0,0,0,,and use the tip of your tongues to lick the hem of the bag-
Dialogue: 0,0:38:28.96,0:38:32.66,Default,,0,0,0,,so that I can glue them together.
Dialogue: 0,0:38:45.94,0:38:46.66,Default,,0,0,0,,Stop!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:48.68,0:38:52.38,Default,,0,0,0,,How does it taste?
Dialogue: 0,0:38:54.58,0:38:56.30,Default,,0,0,0,,It's salty, sir!
Dialogue: 0,0:38:56.94,0:38:58.02,Default,,0,0,0,,Li Liu!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:03.18,0:39:04.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Attendant, lick it again.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:11.46,0:39:13.02,Default,,0,0,0,,What does it taste like?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:13.94,0:39:15.94,Default,,0,0,0,,It's salty, sir.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:22.14,0:39:23.14,Default,,0,0,0,,Li Liu!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:24.42,0:39:26.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Do you recognize your guilt?
Dialogue: 0,0:39:27.38,0:39:30.60,Default,,0,0,0,,Spare my life, milord!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:31.86,0:39:33.86,Default,,0,0,0,,Evildoer Li Liu robbed Lady Sun's bag,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:33.86,0:39:36.74,Default,,0,0,0,,lied to the court, beat decent people into disability, and wronged this old woman.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:36.74,0:39:38.94,Default,,0,0,0,,The evidence is clear and it allows no denial.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:39.06,0:39:41.62,Default,,0,0,0,,Li Liu must recompense the cost of the old skin bag,
Dialogue: 0,0:39:41.62,0:39:43.76,Default,,0,0,0,,and 1,000 taels of silver for her son's injuries and his livelihood.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:43.78,0:39:46.90,Default,,0,0,0,,Li Liu has broken the law, so he shall\Nbe taken into custody for half a year.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:46.98,0:39:48.54,Default,,0,0,0,,Next case!
Dialogue: 0,0:39:51.10,0:39:53.86,Default,,0,0,0,,You're truly marvelous.\NI'll recommend you to my elder brother.
Dialogue: 0,0:39:57.54,0:40:00.24,Default,,0,0,0,,Look, the Strategos is back!
Dialogue: 0,0:40:09.22,0:40:13.12,Default,,0,0,0,,Mister Pang, I have neglected you. I apologize.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:13.18,0:40:14.72,Default,,0,0,0,,No need, sire.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:19.74,0:40:22.10,Default,,0,0,0,,With ability as great as yours, Mister Pang,
Dialogue: 0,0:40:22.10,0:40:25.22,Default,,0,0,0,,why didn't the Strategos write a letter to recommend you?
Dialogue: 0,0:40:28.76,0:40:31.68,Default,,0,0,0,,Here is the letter of recommendation from Kongming.
Dialogue: 0,0:40:31.68,0:40:33.68,Default,,0,0,0,,

